  "notes": "{回答|かいとう} is used for responses to questions, surveys, or inquiries, often in formal contexts.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- No standard transitive pair\n- Pattern: {回答|かいとう}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧\n\nCommon collocations:\n- {回答|かいとう}⟦{者|しゃ}→〜者：04662_sha⟧ (respondent)\n- {回答|かいとう}⟦{率|りつ}→率：03802_ritsu⟧ (response rate)\n- {回答|かいとう}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{求|もと}める→求める：02316_motomeru⟧ (to request a response)\n- {回答|かいとう}⟦{期限|きげん}→期限：12861_kigen⟧ (response deadline)\n\nHomophone note:\n- ⟦{解答|かいとう}→解答：00447_kaitou⟧ (solution to a problem) - same reading, different kanji\n\nDistinction:\n- {回答|かいとう} - response to inquiry/survey (回 = return)\n- ⟦{解答|かいとう}→解答：00447_kaitou⟧ - solution to problem/test (解 = solve)",
